  - m_Id: 607174773329923
    m_Localized: Central Market
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 607174773329924
    m_Localized: "A whirlwind tour with glimpses of multiple vistas. \n\nA traditional
      but asymetrical board with no additional gimmicks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 607174773329925
    m_Localized: Train Street
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 607174773329927
    m_Localized: Coconut Canal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 607174773329929
    m_Localized: Rice Terraces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 607174773329926
    m_Localized: 'Go store hopping while dodging the incoming train! Just try not
      to spend so much on the local eatery.


      A difficult, larger-sized board
      featuring a stage hazard and 3rd party vendors.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253646876672
    m_Localized: Coming Soon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042496
    m_Localized: CURRENTLY UNAVAILABLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 607174773329928
    m_Localized: 'Recommended!


      Dash around the board as you harvest some
      coconuts!


      A fast-paced, medium-sized board with multiple intersections
      and turns.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042497
    m_Localized: Open Space
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042498
    m_Localized: 'Upon landing, encounter an enemy.


      Can set up shop on this
      space.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042499
    m_Localized: '{PLAYER_NAME}''s Storefront'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042500
    m_Localized: 'Upon landing, buy an item from the storefront.


      If <color=#{HEX_COLOR}>{PLAYER_NAME}</color>
      lands, restock items from inventory.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1699095790756298753
  - m_Id: 3522253672042501
    m_Localized: Central Exchange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042503
    m_Localized: '{COLOR} Stamp'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1699095790756298753
  - m_Id: 3522253672042504
    m_Localized: 'Upon passing, collect the <color=#{HEX_COLOR}>{COLOR}</color> stamp.


      Can
      only hold one <color=#{HEX_COLOR}>{COLOR}</color> stamp at a time.


      Fights
      cannot happen on this tile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1699095790756298753
  - m_Id: 3522253672042505
    m_Localized: Red
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042506
    m_Localized: Blue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236800
    m_Localized: Green
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236801
    m_Localized: Orange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236802
    m_Localized: Once More
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236803
    m_Localized: Upon landing, allow the current player to take their turn again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236804
    m_Localized: Backdoor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236805
    m_Localized: 'Upon landing, warp to the connected backdoor.


      Fights cannot
      happen on this tile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236806
    m_Localized: Vendor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236808
    m_Localized: Coconut Tree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236809
    m_Localized: Upon landing, take damage and recieve a Coconut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236810
    m_Localized: Water Coconut Bushel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236811
    m_Localized: 'Upon landing, roll any dice of your choice to reach the given requirement.


      If
      successful, harvest a piece of Water Coconut.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236812
    m_Localized: Stall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236813
    m_Localized: 'Upon landing, buy the item being sold from the stall.


      Additionally,
      choose to invest <sprite="Coin Icon" index=0> into the stall.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236814
    m_Localized: Vacant Stall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236815
    m_Localized: 'Upon landing, choose to invest <sprite="Coin Icon" index=0> gain
      ownership.


      Owning the stall allows you to sell multiple quantities
      of a single item.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
