  - m_Id: 3522253676236881
    m_Localized: Run-of-the-mill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236882
    m_Localized: Standard issue Baggie, no ups or downs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236883
    m_Localized: Overconfident
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236884
    m_Localized: Become more effective with advantage, but less effective without
      advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236885
    m_Localized: Pacifist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236886
    m_Localized: Can't initiate on players, instead give away 25% of your held <sprite="Coin
      Icon" index=0> when landing on other players.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236887
    m_Localized: Exorbitant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236888
    m_Localized: Your stores with +2 items cost 60% more, but stores with 1 item
      are 75% off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236889
    m_Localized: Winner!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3884206022086656
    m_Localized: Pause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3884206051446784
    m_Localized: Resume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3884206051446785
    m_Localized: Options
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3884206051446786
    m_Localized: Exit To Desktop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253672042502
    m_Localized: "Upon passing, heal <color=#4DCF56>33% HP</color> and exchange all
      currently held stamps. \n\nGain <sprite=\"Coin Icon\" index=0> and <color=#7AFFF7>EXP</color>
      relative to the number of exchanged stamps.\n\nThe first player to pass with
      <color=#FDECAD>4000</color><sprite=\"Coin Icon\" index=0> in hand wins!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3522253676236807
    m_Localized: 'Upon landing, choose to enter and buy the item being sold.


      Become
      safe from fights and damage when entered.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3884206051446787
    m_Localized: Storestock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3884206051446788
    m_Localized: Choose a store to restock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3884206051446789
    m_Localized: 'Store resupply!

      Stock up to {STORE_EMPTY_SPACE} more items.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17233078643478528
    m_Localized: Fight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70241055918673920
    m_Localized: Wildcard Stamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70241513529823232
    m_Localized: 'Upon passing, collect the current stamp then change to a different
      stamp.


      Fights cannot happen on this tile.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
